{
  "title": "93: Ad-Dhuhaa الضحى",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "This Surah was revealed in Makkah and has 11 verses. It is narrated from the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) that Allah (s.w.t.) is pleased with person who recites this Surah.\nIf recited together with name of a person who has gone missing, he will return home safe and sound. If something is forgotten somewhere by mistake, the recitation of this Surah keeps its safe until you get it back.\nبِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-merciful, the All-compassionate\nوَالضُّحٰىۙ‏(1)\nWAZ ZOHAA.\nBy the Glorious Morning Light, \nوَالَّيْلِ اِذَا سَجٰىۙ‏(2)\nWAL LAYLE EZAA SAJAA.\nAnd by the Night when it is still, \nمَا وَدَّعَكَ رَبُّكَ وَمَا قَلٰىؕ‏(3)\nMAA WADDA-A’KA RABBOKA WA MAA QALAA.\nThy Guardian-Lord hath not forsaken thee, nor is He displeased. \nوَلَلْاٰخِرَةُ خَيْرٌ لَّكَ مِنَ الْاُوْلٰىؕ‏(4)\nWA LAL-AAKHERATO KHAYRUL LAKA MENAL OOLAA.\nAnd verily the Hereafter will be better for thee than the present. \nوَلَسَوْفَ يُعْطِيْكَ رَبُّكَ فَتَرْضٰىؕ‏(5)\nWA LA-SAWFA YOA’TEEKA RABBOKA FA-TARZAA.\nAnd soon will thy Guardian-Lord give thee (that wherewith) thou shalt be well-pleased. \nاَلَمْ يَجِدْكَ يَتِيْمًا فَاٰوٰى‏(6)\nALAM YAJIDKA YATEEMAN FA-AAWAA.\nDid He not find thee an orphan and give thee shelter (and care)? \nوَوَجَدَكَ ضَآ لًّا فَهَدٰى‏(7)\nWA WAJADAKA ZAAAL-LAN FA-HADAA.\nAnd He found thee wandering, and He gave thee guidance. \nوَوَجَدَكَ عَآئِلًا فَاَغْنٰىؕ‏(8)\nWA WAJADAKA A’AAELAN FA-AGHNAA.\nAnd He found thee in need, and made thee independent. \nفَاَمَّا الْيَتِيْمَ فَلَا تَقْهَرْؕ‏(9)\nFA-AMMAL YATEEMA FALAA TAQHAR.\nTherefore, treat not the orphan with harshness, \nوَاَمَّا السَّآئِلَ فَلَا تَنْهَرْؕ‏(10)\nWA AMMAS SAAA-ELA FALAA TANHAR.\nNor repulse the petitioner (unheard); \nوَاَمَّا بِنِعْمَةِ رَبِّكَ فَحَدِّثْ‏(11)\nWA AMMAA BE-NE’MATE RABBEKA FA-HADDIS.\nBut the bounty of the Lord - rehearse and proclaim! "
}
